"priručnik je napisao Joey Hess E<lt>joeyh@debian.orgE<gt>."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:3
msgid "ltnu - lists packages of a maintainer ordered by last upload"
msgstr "ltnu - navodi pakete održavača poručeno poslednjim upload-om"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:7
msgid "B<env> DEBEMAIL=I<maintainer> B<ltnu> [-m]"
msgstr ""

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:9
msgid "B<ltnu> [-m] I<maintainer>"
msgstr ""

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:11
msgid "B<ltnu> --help"
msgstr "B<ltnu> --help"

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:15
msgid ""
"B<ltnu> (Long Time No Upload) queries the public mirror of the Ultimate "
"Debian Database (udd-mirror.debian.net) for all uploads of packages by the "
"given uploader or maintainer and displays them ordered by the last upload of "
"that package to Debian Unstable, oldest uploads first."
msgstr ""
"B<ltnu> (Long Time No Upload/Dugo vrijeme bez prijenosa) upita javno zrcalo "
"Ultimate Debian baze podataka (udd-mirror.debian.net) za sve prijenose "
"paketa od datog prijenosnika ili održavatelja i prikazuje ih poredanim po "
"posljednjem prijenosu tog paketa na Debian Unstable, najstariji prijenosi "
"prvi."

#. type: textblock
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:21
msgid ""
"Its primary purpose is to check which of your own or your team's packages "
"haven't been uploaded for a long time and likely need a packaging revamp. "
"It's less suitable for MIA team purposes as it doesn't make a difference "
"with regards to who actually uploaded a package."
msgstr ""
"Njegova je primarna svrha provjeriti koji od vaših paketa ili paketa vašeg "
"tima nisu preneseni (upload-ovani) već duže vrijeme i vjerojatno će trebati "
"obnovu ambalaže. To je manje pogodno za MIA timske svrhe jer ne čini razliku "
"s obzirom na to ko je zapravo prenio paket."

#. type: =item
#: ../scripts/ltnu.pod:31
msgid "-m"
msgstr ""

